{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"人のかたちして人にあらず。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"消しゴムー..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲットだぜ(￣^￣)！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい、あしゅりんはお腹がすいています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、ごーっついムッキムキの人を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしゅりんの息で ぶをおおうっ て吹き飛ばしたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、黒人さん希望です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だってなんか強そうでしょ⁇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん。そんな気分です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえず今のあしゅりんは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すっからかん、からっぽです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん不足すぎる(´;ω;` )うぅ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会いたいよう 会いたいよおう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしゅりんが指をならしたら、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんの所に瞬間移動できます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから今から、１人ずつ順番に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会いに行きます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆーて、あしゅりん指ならせなああああああい(´･_･`)んきゃ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめーんちゅっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ももいろパンチ！←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしゅりん風邪ひきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嘘です。元気です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん風邪ひいてないですか⁇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあ、ひいてても安心してください"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしゅりんが治したげるかんねっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わわわわ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしゅりんの、くちが好き"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言ってくださる方がいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあメンバーなんですけどね⁇にゃ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしゅりんは、自分のくち"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんま好きじゃないです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だってね、すぐ乾燥するの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リップクリーム必需！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも最近リップクリームなくなりそうでね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと、いい匂いのやつ買いたいと思っちょん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、保湿してくれるのじゃなきゃ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーあだぴょん⊂((・x・))⊃"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お店で探さんとのん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだ、まあやとお泊り会しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん楽しかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、最近まあやにツンツンするの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"卒業しまちた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんとなく。←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"